sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker
    participant Q as Queue
    participant S as Downstream Service

    W->>Q: Poll for job
    Q-->>W: Job #123
    loop Up to 3 attempts
        W->>S: Process job
        alt Success
            S-->>W: 200 OK
        else Transient failure
            S-->>W: 503 Service Unavailable
            W->>W: Back off (exponential)
        end
    end
    W->>Q: Ack job
